  "privacyIntro": "This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store and protect your information when you use this app. Please read it carefully before you start.",
  "privacySecCollect": "1. Information We Collect",
  "privacySecCollectBody": "When you create an account, we collect your email address along with the nickname and avatar you choose to provide. For tool features such as the compass and noise detector, the app accesses the relevant device sensors only after you grant permission. We do not collect personal information unrelated to your use of this app.",
  "privacySecUse": "2. How We Use Information",
  "privacySecUseBody": "Collected information is used only to create and maintain your account, sync your profile and membership benefits across devices, improve the product experience, and contact you when necessary. We never use your information for purposes unrelated to this app.",
  "privacySecStore": "3. Data Storage and Security",
  "privacySecStoreBody": "Account data is stored in a Supabase cloud database and protected with encrypted transfers and access control. Local caches such as images stay on your device only, and you can clear them anytime in Settings > Clear Cache.",
  "privacySecShare": "4. Information Sharing",
  "privacySecShareBody": "We do not sell or rent your personal information. We share only the minimum data required in these cases: with payment platforms (Apple App Store / Google Play) to complete membership purchases, and where required by law or necessary to protect our legal rights.",
  "privacySecAds": "5. Advertising",
  "privacySecAdsBody": "The free version shows banner ads at a few places within the app, served by Google AdMob. AdMob may use device identifiers and ad interaction data to select and measure ads, as described in the Google privacy policy. No ad is loaded once you purchase Pro Unlock. This app does not request the App Tracking Transparency permission and does not send your tool data to ad networks.",
  "privacySecRights": "6. Your Rights",
  "privacySecRightsBody": "You may at any time change your nickname and avatar in Edit Profile, delete local data in Settings > Clear Cache, and delete your cloud profile by deleting your account. To export or request deletion of your data, contact us using the details below.",
  "privacySecUpdate": "7. Policy Updates",
  "privacySecUpdateBody": "We may update this policy from time to time. The latest version is always published on this page, and we will notify you in the app for significant changes. We recommend reviewing this page periodically.",
  "privacySecContact": "8. Contact Us",
  "privacySecContactBody": "If you have any questions or suggestions about this Privacy Policy, please reach us at support@aknot.uk. We will respond within a reasonable period.",
  "agreementIntro": "This User Agreement sets out the terms that apply when you use this app, and the rights and obligations between you and us. Please read it carefully before you start. By using this app, you agree to be bound by this Agreement.",
  "agreementSecAccept": "1. Acceptance of the Agreement",
  "agreementSecAcceptBody": "This Agreement is a binding contract between you and us. If you do not agree to any part of it, please stop using the app. If you are a minor, please read it together with your parent or guardian.",
  "agreementSecService": "2. The Service",
  "agreementSecServiceBody": "This app provides a set of practical on-device tools, including memo, compass, noise detector, level, ruler, flashlight and tide tables. Features may be adjusted as the product evolves, and we will do our best to keep the experience stable.",
  "agreementSecAccount": "3. Your Account",
  "agreementSecAccountBody": "Some features require an account. You can sign in with Apple or Google, or continue as a guest. You are responsible for keeping your account credentials safe and for activity carried out under your account. Your account data is stored in a Supabase cloud database, as described in our Privacy Policy.",
  "agreementSecFree": "4. Free Usage and Advertising",
  "agreementSecFreeBody": "The free version includes a limited number of tool uses and shows banner ads served by Google AdMob. You can watch an in-app ad to earn additional free uses, up to the free limit. Usage counts are recorded on our servers and linked to a device identifier, so reinstalling the app does not reset them.",
  "agreementSecPurchase": "5. Purchases and Refunds",
  "agreementSecPurchaseBody": "Pro Unlock is a one-time purchase that removes ads and lifts the free usage limit. All payments are processed by the Apple App Store or Google Play, and refunds are handled under the rules of that platform, so we cannot process refunds directly. Purchases are tied to your account; signing in on another device restores your benefits.",
  "agreementSecConduct": "6. Acceptable Use",
  "agreementSecConductBody": "You agree not to use this app for any unlawful purpose, not to interfere with its normal operation, and not to reverse engineer, decompile or attempt to extract its source code. You also agree not to use automated means to access the service in bulk.",
  "agreementSecIp": "7. Intellectual Property",
  "agreementSecIpBody": "The app, including its code, design, icons, text and other materials, is owned by us and protected by applicable laws. You may use the app for personal purposes only, and may not copy, modify, distribute or use any part of it commercially without our written permission.",
  "agreementSecDisclaimer": "8. Disclaimer",
  "agreementSecDisclaimerBody": "Tool readings such as those from the compass, noise detector and level come from your device sensors and are indicative only. They are not a substitute for professional instruments and must not be used where accuracy is safety-critical, such as in construction, medical or legal contexts. We do not accept liability for losses arising from reliance on these readings.",
  "agreementSecUpdate": "9. Changes to This Agreement",
  "agreementSecUpdateBody": "We may update this Agreement from time to time. The latest version is always shown on this page, and we will notify you in the app for significant changes. Continuing to use the app after an update means you accept the revised Agreement.",
  "agreementSecContact": "10. Contact Us",
  "agreementSecContactBody": "If you have any questions or suggestions about this Agreement, please reach us at support@aknot.uk. We will respond within a reasonable period.",
